    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude82 <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution \u2013 Relax. Upgrade. Collect!</strong> \ud83d\ude82</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for a <strong>cozy and relaxing adventure</strong> to chill out with? Welcome aboard <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution</strong>, where you\u2019ll build, upgrade, and customize your very own train as it travels through <strong>beautiful handcrafted landscapes</strong>. Relax with idle progress or <strong>test your management skills in this epic journey. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your play style: <strong>kick back and chill</strong> or <strong>strategize and rise to the top!</strong> The journey is yours to shape, and with the right upgrades, you\u2019ll evolve your train from a humble handcar to a <strong>mighty long locomotive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f <strong>What Makes This Ride Awesome:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Relax and Play Your Way</strong> \u2013 Whether you want a casual chill vibe or a challenge, we've got you!<br>\u2705 <strong>Beautifully Crafted Zones</strong> \u2013 Travel through stunning, cozy environments with unique themes.<br>\u2705 <strong>Engineer Heroes</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade heroes with special abilities to automate progress and keep things rolling!<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 From handcars to steam, diesel, and beyond\u2014build YOUR ultimate train!<br>\u2705 <strong>Optimized Progression for Maximum Fun</strong> \u2013 Experience that sweet, satisfying feeling when every upgrade just clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop aboard and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude82 <strong>We\u2019re waiting for you at the next station!</strong> \ud83d\ude82</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\ude82 <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution \u2013 Relax. Upgrade. Collect!</strong> \ud83d\ude82</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Looking for a <strong>cozy and relaxing adventure</strong> to chill out with? Welcome aboard <strong>TrainClicker Idle Evolution</strong>, where you\u2019ll build, upgrade, and customize your very own train as it travels through <strong>beautiful handcrafted landscapes</strong>. Relax with idle progress or <strong>test your management skills in this epic journey. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your play style: <strong>kick back and chill</strong> or <strong>strategize and rise to the top!</strong> The journey is yours to shape, and with the right upgrades, you\u2019ll evolve your train from a humble handcar to a <strong>mighty long locomotive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udee4\ufe0f <strong>What Makes This Ride Awesome:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2705 <strong>Relax and Play Your Way</strong> \u2013 Whether you want a casual chill vibe or a challenge, we've got you!<br>\u2705 <strong>Beautifully Crafted Zones</strong> \u2013 Travel through stunning, cozy environments with unique themes.<br>\u2705 <strong>Engineer Heroes</strong> \u2013 Unlock and upgrade heroes with special abilities to automate progress and keep things rolling!<br>\u2705 <strong>Endless Customization &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 From handcars to steam, diesel, and beyond\u2014build YOUR ultimate train!<br>\u2705 <strong>Optimized Progression for Maximum Fun</strong> \u2013 Experience that sweet, satisfying feeling when every upgrade just clicks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hop aboard and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude82 <strong>We\u2019re waiting for you at the next station!</strong> \ud83d\ude82</p>",
    "short_description": "\ud83d\ude82 Cozy idle train game. Enjoy a journey from steam to modern locomotives in idle style! \ud83d\ude82",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cWould highly recommend for anyone that likes idle games. Train clicker is a pretty chill and charming grind towards building your train. It seems to be a port from a mobile game and the developer seems to be actively updating it to be more suited for PC. The recent talents update gave reason to finish the level sequence and gain prestige and the skins give the long term purpose of building your train to your desired aesthetic! I'd also say it is appropriately priced!  I'm hoping in the future that you could spend gems in the game (which you get for free) on unlocking skin cards and it would be cool to see a directory of all possible skins!\u201d<br>Steam<br>",
